From: GloriousEggroll <gloriouseggroll@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] vkd3d: Print the version string of dirty-tree builds.

The INFO build line only shows the build hash, so a modified build looks
like upstream apart from the '+'. Also print vkd3d_version, which GE-Proton
tags with "-GE-Proton(dirty)" when the tree carries patches, so bug reports
show that the build is not upstream vkd3d-proton.
---
--- a/libs/vkd3d/device.c
+++ b/libs/vkd3d/device.c
@@ -696,7 +696,7 @@
     /* Builds from dirty trees generate vkd3d_version ending with a '+'. */
     dirty_tree_build = sizeof(vkd3d_version) >= 2 && vkd3d_version[sizeof(vkd3d_version) - 2] == '+';
     if (dirty_tree_build)
-        INFO("vkd3d-proton - build: %015"PRIx64"+.\n", vkd3d_build >> 4);
+        INFO("vkd3d-proton - build: %015"PRIx64"+ (%s).\n", vkd3d_build >> 4, vkd3d_version);
     else
         INFO("vkd3d-proton - build: %015"PRIx64".\n", vkd3d_build);
 
